      "matchText": "gomat",
      "term": "gomat",
      "definition": "A Sanskrit word meaning \"possessing cattle\" — and, in early Vedic society, the practical definition of a wealthy man. Herds were the unit of riches: bride prices, ritual gifts, and debts were all reckoned in cows."
    },
