      "matchText": "aghnya",
      "term": "aghnya",
      "definition": "A Sanskrit epithet for the cow, literally \"not to be slaughtered.\" Used in the Rigveda, it is the earliest seed of the sacred, protected status that cattle would hold in later Hindu tradition."
    },
